Q: CSS Flexbox collapsing despite being assigned a height A: <pre><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
  &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;
  &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;
  &lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;styles/main.css&quot;&gt;

  &lt;title&gt;Bullpen Solver&lt;/title&gt;
  &lt;link rel=&quot;icon&quot; href=&quot;images/favicon.png&quot;&gt;

  &lt;!-- Loads jQuery --&gt;
  &lt;script src=&quot;https://code.jquery.com/jquery-4.0.0.min.js&quot; integrity=&quot;sha256-OaVG6prZf4v69dPg6PhVattBXkcOWQB62pdZ3ORyrao=&quot; crossorigin=&quot;anonymous&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
  &lt;script src=&quot;scripts/loadGrid.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
  &lt;script&gt;
    window.onload = () =&gt; {
      loadGrid(6);
    };
  &lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;

  &lt;div id=&quot;palette&quot;&gt;

  &lt;header&gt;
    &lt;h1&gt;Bullpen Solver&lt;/h1&gt;
  &lt;/header&gt;
  &lt;div id=&quot;main-content&quot;&gt;
    &lt;div id=&quot;left-column&quot; class=&quot;spacing-column&quot;&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div id=&quot;board&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div id=&quot;right-column&quot; class=&quot;spacing-column&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;
</code></pre>

Q: Angular 4 : Click on a link with parameters A: <p><strong>Using [routerLink] :</strong></p>

<pre><code>&lt;a [routerLink]="['/route-name', id]" href=""&gt;Go to mymodule&lt;/a&gt;
</code></pre>

<p>also you shouldn't forget to change routing config like :</p>

<pre><code>[path: 'route-name/:id', component:ComponentName, pathMatch: 'full']
</code></pre>

<p><strong>Using navigateByUrl :</strong></p>

<pre><code>import { Router } from '@angular/router';

constructor(private router: Router) { }

myFunc = function () {
        this.router.navigateByUrl('/route-name', {queryParams:{param-key: param-value}});
};
</code></pre>
